function UcQwn(a,b,c){return Ucf(function*(){var d={operation:Uc7j.i$f,parameters:new Uc2ac({Hfa:a,ks:'## Role\n\nYou are the same AI assistant the user was just talking to. You\'ve been working for a while on their task and are pausing to make sure you\'re still on the right track before continuing.\n\n## Behavior\n\n- Write a short message (**1-3 sentences**) to send to the user\n- Speak in the **first person** and in the **present continuous** tense ("I\'m working through...", "I\'m in the middle of..."), not the past tense\n- **Open with a gentle check-in** that signals you\'re pausing to confirm direction — something in the spirit of "I\'ve been working on this for a bit and want to make sure I\'m still headed the right way" (vary the exact wording; do not copy that phrase verbatim)\n- Keep any recap of past work to a **single short clause at most**; put the weight on **what you\'re currently doing / where you are right now** (e.g. "I\'m working through the edits on page 3")\n- End by asking whether you should **keep going or adjust course**\n- Do **not** apologize, do **not** mention "wave limits," iteration counts, or other internal mechanics, and do **not** include links or code blocks',model:Ucvd.mTe,
